### imwrite

```c++
cv::imwrite("resource/output.jpg", img);
```

OpenCV根据文件名后缀决定保存格式

**设置JPEG质量**

```c++
std::vector<int> params;
params.push_back(cv::IMWRITE_JPEG_QUALITY);
params.push_back(95);

cv::imwrite("resource/output.jpg", img, params);
```

数值越大，质量越高，文件越大

**设置PNG压缩等级**

```c++
std::vector<int> params;
params.push_back(cv::IMWRITE_PNG_COMPRESSION);
params.push_back(3);

cv::imwrite("resource/output.png", img, params);
```

数值越大，压缩越强，但是保存更慢